<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>base<sp/>2<sp/>-&gt;<sp/>for<sp/>binary<sp/>representation<sp/>0<sp/>to<sp/>1<sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>base<sp/>8<sp/>-&gt;<sp/>for<sp/>octal<sp/>representation<sp/>0<sp/>to<sp/>7<sp/>base<sp/></highlight></codeline>
