<codeline><highlight class="normal">####<sp/>Use</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">There<sp/>are<sp/>2<sp/>modes<sp/>of<sp/>use<sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">An<sp/>interactive<sp/>mode<sp/>&amp;<sp/><sp/>Simple<sp/>command-line<sp/>mode<sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">*Simple<sp/>Command-line<sp/>mode<sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">just<sp/>do<sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```bash<sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">bcv<sp/>[option]<sp/>&lt;numeric<sp/>value&gt;<sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```<sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
